{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a1-explainer-about-basketball-how-people-play-it-and-why-it-is-popular/audio/main-4411f4a3b93e.mp3","durationSec":173.616,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":1.42,"text":"Basketball is a team sport."},{"start":2.06,"end":3.34,"text":"Two teams play in one game."},{"start":3.9,"end":5.96,"text":"Each team has five players on the court."},{"start":6.5,"end":8.18,"text":"The court is the floor where they play."},{"start":8.7,"end":10.14,"text":"The two teams share one ball."},{"start":10.76,"end":13.82,"text":"Players bounce the ball, pass the ball, and run with it."},{"start":14.4,"end":16.54,"text":"Each team tries to shoot the ball through a hoop."},{"start":17.2,"end":19.06,"text":"A hoop is a basket on a backboard."},{"start":19.54,"end":21.94,"text":"The backboard is a flat board behind the basket."},{"start":22.54,"end":25.2,"text":"The ball goes down through the hoop, and the team is happy."},{"start":25.2,"end":26.88,"text":"Teams win with points."},{"start":27.52,"end":29.94,"text":"A shot that goes through the hoop is a field goal."},{"start":30.48,"end":31.98,"text":"A field goal is worth two points."},{"start":32.82,"end":34.44,"text":"There is a big line on the court."},{"start":34.98,"end":36.22,"text":"It is the three-point line."},{"start":36.9,"end":39.62,"text":"A shot from behind this line is worth three points."},{"start":40.22,"end":43.96,"text":"So a close shot gives two points, and a far shot gives three points."},{"start":44.72,"end":47.46,"text":"The team with more points at the end wins the game."},{"start":47.46,"end":50.62,"text":"Points make the game fast and fun to watch."},{"start":50.62,"end":52.58,"text":"Basketball has a maker."},{"start":53.06,"end":54.78,"text":"His name was James Naismith."},{"start":54.78,"end":56.22,"text":"He was a gym teacher."},{"start":56.22,"end":59.14,"text":"He made basketball in 1891."},{"start":59.8,"end":62.3,"text":"He made it in Springfield, a city in Massachusetts."},{"start":63.16,"end":66.24,"text":"The first game was on December 21, 1891."},{"start":67.24,"end":68,"text":"That was in winter."},{"start":68.74,"end":73.56,"text":"A gym is warm and dry in winter, so a ball game inside a gym was a good idea."},{"start":74.26,"end":77.12,"text":"Many school gyms today still have a hoop on each wall."},{"start":77.62,"end":79.9,"text":"A school gym in Japan often has them too."},{"start":80.56,"end":82.4,"text":"Many people play basketball for fun."},{"start":82.88,"end":84.66,"text":"Some people play in a big league."},{"start":84.66,"end":87.62,"text":"A league is a group of teams that play each other."},{"start":88.36,"end":91.94,"text":"The National Basketball Association is a big basketball league."},{"start":91.94,"end":93.72,"text":"People call it the NBA."},{"start":94.72,"end":97.02,"text":"NBA games are on TV in many countries."},{"start":97.92,"end":101.16,"text":"Fans watch the best players run, jump, and shoot."},{"start":101.92,"end":106.8,"text":"The NBA is one big reason people all over the world know basketball."},{"start":107.98,"end":110.36,"text":"Michael Jordan is a famous basketball player."},{"start":110.36,"end":112.8,"text":"His full name is Michael Jeffrey Jordan."},{"start":113.34,"end":114.7,"text":"People also call him MJ."},{"start":115.4,"end":118.38,"text":"He was born on February 17, 1963."},{"start":119.42,"end":124.62,"text":"He played 15 seasons in the NBA between 1984 and 2003."},{"start":125.34,"end":126.7,"text":"He played for the Chicago Bulls."},{"start":127.42,"end":130.42,"text":"He won six NBA championships with the Chicago Bulls."},{"start":131.16,"end":136.76,"text":"In the 1995-96 season, the Chicago Bulls had 72 regular-season wins."},{"start":137.5,"end":138.98,"text":"That was a record at that time."},{"start":139.32,"end":143.72,"text":"He jumped very high, so fans called him Air Jordan and His Airness."},{"start":145.42,"end":146.8,"text":"Basketball is easy to start."},{"start":147.32,"end":148.78,"text":"You need one ball and one hoop."},{"start":149.32,"end":150.8,"text":"You do not need a big field."},{"start":151.42,"end":153.64,"text":"A small park court or a school gym is enough."},{"start":154.38,"end":156.74,"text":"You can play with one friend or with ten friends."},{"start":157.4,"end":158.26,"text":"The game is fast."},{"start":158.88,"end":161.3,"text":"The ball moves up and down the court all the time."},{"start":162.02,"end":165.14,"text":"Points come often, so there is always something to see."},{"start":165.88,"end":168.44,"text":"Players jump, run, and pass."},{"start":168.78,"end":173.32,"text":"For many people, this is why basketball is fun to play and fun to watch."}],"words":[{"text":"Basketball","start":0,"end":0.38},{"text":"is","start":0.38,"end":0.72},{"text":"a","start":0.72,"end":0.9},{"text":"team","start":0.9,"end":1.08},{"text":"sport","start":1.08,"end":1.42},{"text":"Two","start":2.06,"end":2.14},{"text":"teams","start":2.14,"end":2.44},{"text":"play","start":2.44,"end":2.68},{"text":"in","start":2.68,"end":2.86},{"text":"one","start":2.86,"end":3.04},{"text":"game","start":3.04,"end":3.34},{"text":"Each","start":3.9,"end":4.08},{"text":"team","start":4.08,"end":4.38},{"text":"has","start":4.38,"end":4.64},{"text":"five","start":4.64,"end":4.96},{"text":"players","start":4.96,"end":5.36},{"text":"on","start":5.36,"end":5.62},{"text":"the","start":5.62,"end":5.76},{"text":"court","start":5.76,"end":5.96},{"text":"The","start":6.5,"end":6.72},{"text":"court","start":6.72,"end":6.9},{"text":"is","start":6.9,"end":7.1},{"text":"the","start":7.1,"end":7.24},{"text":"floor","start":7.24,"end":7.54},{"text":"where","start":7.54,"end":7.76},{"text":"they","start":7.76,"end":7.94},{"text":"play","start":7.94,"end":8.18},{"text":"The","start":8.7,"end":8.82},{"text":"two","start":8.82,"end":9.02},{"text":"teams","start":9.02,"end":9.32},{"text":"share","start":9.32,"end":9.58},{"text"